Oh, no.

1040
00:43:08.200 --> 00:43:17.100
So ours is, it's like a rubbery, hard thing that you put in a bowl and pour boiling water

1041
00:43:17.100 --> 00:43:18.600
on, and then it melts.

1042
00:43:18.840 --> 00:43:20.400
The rubbery thing melts.

1043
00:43:20.640 --> 00:43:21.440
The rubbery thing melts.

1044
00:43:21.440 --> 00:43:24.360
So the thing he's eating, he's eating the concentrated...

1045
00:43:25.240 --> 00:43:29.920
I used to, when I ate, because it's not vegetarian, when I ate meat, I would eat it raw.

1046
00:43:30.240 --> 00:43:31.020
I loved it raw.

1047
00:43:31.660 --> 00:43:35.120
Does it taste different than once you've put the hot water on it?

