It's just, it's harder.

1050
00:43:38.360 --> 00:43:38.920
Oh, my gosh.

1051
00:43:38.920 --> 00:43:42.000
You just sort of like tug at it like you're eating an eraser.

1052
00:43:42.460 --> 00:43:43.460
Oh, my gosh.

1053
00:43:43.680 --> 00:43:44.780
This is fascinating.

1054
00:43:44.800 --> 00:43:45.560
I loved it.

1055
00:43:45.680 --> 00:43:48.160
We both were like, wait, what is he eating in the box?

1056
00:43:48.280 --> 00:43:48.700
It's like...

1057
