1061
00:44:03.960 --> 00:44:04.080
Yeah.

1062
00:44:04.080 --> 00:44:08.080
That you, because they make like pre-made cups, but they're just for eating.

1063
00:44:08.260 --> 00:44:10.020
You could put them in like a kid's lunch box.

1064
00:44:10.020 --> 00:44:11.580
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

