1066
00:44:14.760 --> 00:44:14.840
Right.

1067
00:44:14.980 --> 00:44:17.840
Because like Tim is eating the ingredient.

1068
00:44:18.500 --> 00:44:22.000
It would be like if Jim were holding a box of powdered Jell-O.

1069
00:44:22.140 --> 00:44:23.440
And then poured it into his mouth.

1070
00:44:23.520 --> 00:44:24.360
Yes, exactly.

