was soap.

1083
00:44:52.440 --> 00:44:52.780
Oh.

1084
00:44:52.780 --> 00:44:56.960
And so you use the soap and slowly you get the stapler.

1085
00:44:57.300 --> 00:44:58.360
That's really cute.

1086
00:44:58.640 --> 00:44:59.120
I know.

1087
00:44:59.660 --> 00:45:01.120
People are really creative.

1088
00:45:01.320 --> 00:45:02.900
It is, I have to say.

1089
00:45:03.040 --> 00:45:03.180
Yeah.

1090
00:45:03.840 --> 00:45:04.320
Soap.

1091
00:45:05.300 --> 00:45:05.780
Jeez.

1092
00:45:06.560 --> 00:45:06.900
All right.

