with which Ricky was standing next to me talking about testicular cancer.

1105
00:45:34.120 --> 00:45:35.680
And grabbing his balls.

1106
00:45:35.840 --> 00:45:35.980
Yeah.

1107
00:45:36.460 --> 00:45:42.600
And like you, since you're seated and he's standing, your face is exactly even with his

1108
00:45:42.600 --> 00:45:42.960
crotch.

1109
00:45:43.140 --> 00:45:43.300
Yes.

1110
00:45:43.720 --> 00:45:43.960
Yeah.

1111
00:45:44.240 --> 00:45:50.360
And I didn't, and because it was the pilot, we weren't so used to, you know, how this

1112
00:45:50.360 --> 00:45:52.480
was going to play out and how this was going to be.

1113
00:45:52.860 --> 00:45:57.940
So when I sat there and I had already this bit of brie sandwich in my mouth, that's another

1114
00:45:57.940 --> 00:45:59.800
line I get a lot of, bit of brie.

1115
00:46:00.100 --> 00:46:00.740
Bit of brie.

1116
00:46:01.040 --> 00:46:01.300
Bit of brie.

1117
00:46:01.820 --> 00:46:02.860
And I turn.

1118
00:46:03.940 --> 00:46:07.260
What you can't, you just can't, you know this, you just can't tell it on camera because

1119
00:46:07.260 --> 00:46:11.860
you know on camera, you have to stand closer to someone than you would in real life.

1120
00:46:12.100 --> 00:46:12.280
Right.

1121
00:46:12.380 --> 00:46:15.520
In real life, it would be like, it's so awkward that you were this close.

1122
00:46:15.520 --> 00:46:17.540
But for camera, you have to be close.

1123
00:46:17.960 --> 00:46:18.920
Who was close?

1124
