I'm not going to lie.

1125
00:46:22.100 --> 00:46:27.380
And I didn't have to hold the brie sandwich in my cheek.

1126
00:46:27.620 --> 00:46:28.860
It just wouldn't go down.

1127
00:46:31.300 --> 00:46:35.760
But it was a wonderful, wonderful little moment of scene.

1128
00:46:36.320 --> 00:46:40.220
We shot that same scene for our pilot.

