00:46:51.340 --> 00:46:52.820
But ours got cut.

1133
00:46:53.520 --> 00:46:54.180
I know.

1134
00:46:54.340 --> 00:46:55.680
It didn't make it in for time.

1135
00:46:55.880 --> 00:47:00.000
Because we had to get our episodes down to like 21 minutes, 30 seconds.

1136
00:47:00.220 --> 00:47:00.580
Oh, that's hot.

1137
00:47:00.960 --> 00:47:02.440
So we were like 29.

1138
00:47:02.520 --> 00:47:04.180
Yeah, you guys had extra time.

1139
00:47:04.280 --> 00:47:04.460
Yeah.

1140
00:47:05.100 --> 00:47:13.020
But this sort of like physicality where you're in someone's space awkwardly, I feel like just kept coming back, especially for Michael Scott.

1141
00:47:13.200 --> 00:47:18.580
Like he would talk to Jim and put his foot up on the desk, like basically lean in.

1142
00:47:18.680 --> 00:47:20.900
So it's just like crotch facing you.

1143
00:47:21.220 --> 00:47:21.320
Yeah.

1144
00:47:21.320 --> 00:47:23.860
And there are a lot of moments like that.

1145
00:47:25.260 --> 00:47:30.620
I love those things, though, and especially when, if they're not in the script and you're not expecting them at all.

1146
00:47:30.780 --> 00:47:30.940
Yeah.

1147
00:47:31.060 --> 00:47:41.300
I mean, obviously this brie scene was scripted, so I knew what the script was and the lines were, but I just didn't plan on having Ricky's crotch quite so clear to my brie.

1148
00:47:43.400 --> 00:47:48.420
I didn't even count for that one ball to be so close to your sandwich.

1149
00:47:50.480 --> 00:47:59.300
Speaking of not being able to swallow your brie and breaking, you know, we broke all the time, but there were a few people that broke the moSt.

1150
