00:48:11.080 --> 00:48:18.360
I remember Mindy, the character, doing the cabbage soup diet and looking awful.

1154
00:48:18.520 --> 00:48:26.100
And I will do this now and I'll know if someone watches your show well, because she'll go, you're going to look amazing.

1155
00:48:28.260 --> 00:48:29.460
I love it.

1156
00:48:29.720 --> 00:48:31.060
Okay, so Mindy cracks up a lot.

1157
00:48:31.180 --> 00:48:31.760
Yes, yes.

