1248
00:53:02.740 --> 00:53:07.640
I was doing, I had a line, something like, well, Jennifer, so I say something like, well,

1249
00:53:07.920 --> 00:53:11.060
Jennifer said there might be some job losses or downsizing.

1250
00:53:11.220 --> 00:53:11.420
Yes.

1251
00:53:11.680 --> 00:53:12.140
Or something.

1252
