But he said you like make it worse.

1254
00:53:17.280 --> 00:53:23.100
And Ricky was sitting and Steve was sitting at the monitors for me doing this line.

1255
00:53:24.060 --> 00:53:25.360
And I did it.

1256
00:53:25.520 --> 00:53:28.960
The note was a little less soap opera loose.

1257
