Was he, they co-directed, but was Stephen Merchant more the one sort of like yelling action,

1264
00:53:57.120 --> 00:53:58.560
giving notes and stuff like that?

1265
00:53:58.680 --> 00:54:01.100
Yeah, I think Steve would have done action more.

1266
00:54:01.100 --> 00:54:05.220
Or our first AD, more so if Rick is in the scene.

1267
00:54:05.360 --> 00:54:10.120
If he's not in the scene, he's usually changed back into his sweats and chomping on a sandwich,

1268
00:54:10.620 --> 00:54:11.880
watching the monitor.

1269
00:54:14.120 --> 00:54:17.180
But yeah, so that would be Steve normally.

1270
00:54:17.660 --> 00:54:18.920
Yeah, that makes sense.

1271
00:54:19.060 --> 00:54:19.520
I mean, because...

1272
00:54:19.520 --> 00:54:24.460
