That seems so stressful to me.

1277
00:54:28.920 --> 00:54:30.640
You would like that, Angela.

1278
00:54:30.820 --> 00:54:33.000
I feel like, because you have the all creative brain.

1279
00:54:33.200 --> 00:54:33.580
I don't...

1280
00:54:33.580 --> 00:54:33.860
Right.

1281
00:54:33.980 --> 00:54:34.880
I can't direct.

