00:54:45.500 --> 00:54:46.100
Oh, I'd do that.

1289
00:54:46.280 --> 00:54:46.640
Exactly.

1290
00:54:46.640 --> 00:54:51.480
So you could sort of like be the eye outside the scene, and I'm in it.

1291
00:54:51.680 --> 00:54:54.300
Oh, but now I'm directing again, which I think I can't do.

1292
00:54:54.440 --> 00:54:54.580
Oh, okay.

1293
00:54:54.800 --> 00:54:54.960
Well.

1294
00:54:54.960 --> 00:54:57.920
I don't know if my brain goes there to direct.

1295
00:54:58.380 --> 00:54:59.560
I like producing.

1296
00:54:59.920 --> 00:55:00.280
Yeah.

1297
00:55:00.400 --> 00:55:05.480
I really enjoyed that side of my career, and I obviously love acting, but yeah, the directing,

1298
00:55:05.640 --> 00:55:08.600
I'm like, my little brain, and I don't know if I could take it all in.

1299
00:55:08.780 --> 00:55:11.860
You've got to be aware of every single area ever going on.

1300
00:55:12.040 --> 00:55:12.340
Yeah.

1301
00:55:12.500 --> 00:55:14.320
And I think my brain would explode.

1302
00:55:14.780 --> 00:55:21.280
I'm also such an inside-out performer as an actor, so I'm very much about like, what am

1303
00:55:21.280 --> 00:55:21.840
I feeling?

1304
00:55:21.840 --> 00:55:22.900
What do I want?

1305
00:55:22.900 --> 00:55:24.220
What's motivating me?

1306
00:55:24.540 --> 00:55:28.060
And I'm not really aware of my surroundings.

1307
00:55:28.480 --> 00:55:30.740
Like, I'm not good at decorating a room.

1308
00:55:31.100 --> 00:55:34.020
Like, I don't know where to put the chair and the couch and the things.

1309
00:55:34.180 --> 00:55:37.720
And my husband, who's a director, like, he's really good at that.

1310
00:55:37.840 --> 00:55:40.080
Like, he knows how to build a visual picture.

1311
00:55:40.380 --> 00:55:40.560
Right.

1312
00:55:41.140 --> 00:55:45.380
I just know how to, like, come from, like, sort of an emotional place.

1313
00:55:45.580 --> 00:55:45.860
Got it.

1314
00:55:46.020 --> 00:55:46.140
Yeah.

1315
00:55:46.300 --> 00:55:46.760
I think.

1316
00:55:47.000 --> 00:55:47.180
Yeah.

1317
00:55:47.460 --> 00:55:49.160
So that's why I think I can't direct.

1318
00:55:50.600 --> 00:55:50.960
Maybe.

1319
00:55:51.220 --> 00:55:51.820
I don't know.

1320
00:55:51.900 --> 00:55:52.200
I don't know.

1321
00:55:52.260 --> 00:55:53.660
Don't say never, lady.

1322
00:55:53.980 --> 00:55:54.700
Don't say never.

1323
00:55:55.080 --> 00:55:56.440
Well, I did sign us up.

1324
00:55:56.580 --> 00:55:56.660
We'll all direct together.

1325
00:55:56.660 --> 00:55:59.100
I did sign us up to direct a show together, me and you.

1326
00:55:59.200 --> 00:55:59.280
Oh, dear.

1327
00:55:59.440 --> 00:55:59.840
No, I'm kidding.

1328
00:56:00.000 --> 00:56:00.100
Okay.

1329
00:56:01.100 --> 00:56:04.740
We'll all direct something together, but we'll really leave it to Angela.

1330
00:56:04.800 --> 00:56:05.060
No.

1331
00:56:05.060 --> 00:56:05.880
I like this idea.

1332
00:56:06.000 --> 00:56:06.180
Yeah.

1333
00:56:06.640 --> 00:56:08.140
And we can sit and have coffee.

1334
00:56:08.400 --> 00:56:09.880
Like, how many directors do you have?

1335
00:56:10.040 --> 00:56:10.400
Three.

1336
00:56:10.720 --> 00:56:10.860
Three.

1337
00:56:11.600 --> 00:56:13.380
Technically one, but.

1338
00:56:15.960 --> 00:56:16.480
Okay.

1339
00:56:16.480 --> 00:56:23.260
We have to talk about this moment where Don is attempting to fix Tim's hair.

1340
00:56:23.420 --> 00:56:27.860
And you have, like, these great fingernails and you're kind of going through his hair.

1341
00:56:28.020 --> 00:56:28.240
Yeah.

1342
00:56:28.240 --> 00:56:31.920
How much of that moment was improvised between the two of you?

1343
00:56:32.140 --> 00:56:32.400
All of it.

1344
00:56:32.400 --> 00:56:32.780
All of it.

1345
00:56:32.900 --> 00:56:33.080
Yeah.

1346
00:56:33.200 --> 00:56:34.200
So what was the idea?

1347
00:56:34.340 --> 00:56:38.040
The idea was like, okay, we need to see you guys be kind of flirty.

1348
00:56:38.880 --> 00:56:42.560
Like, yeah, just watching, you know, that moment, you know, well, you know, when you

1349
00:56:42.560 --> 00:56:45.640
fancy someone, but you've never acknowledged it between you.

1350
00:56:46.600 --> 00:56:51.020
So really what you're trying to do is engage in some way.

1351
00:56:51.240 --> 00:56:57.220
And of course, touch is always a nice thing to kind of get in and I'll do anything for

1352
00:56:57.220 --> 00:56:57.400
someone.

1353
