Yeah.

1373
00:57:46.580 --> 00:57:50.180
So you, how did they know you guys were going to be so great together?

1374
00:57:50.580 --> 00:57:50.680
That's a very good point.

1375
00:57:51.240 --> 00:57:57.120
I mean, I did two castings and the last one was with Ricky and Asha Teller, our producer

1376
00:57:57.120 --> 00:57:59.360
and Steve and casting.

1377
00:57:59.420 --> 00:58:00.460
And that was it.

1378
00:58:00.620 --> 00:58:00.780
Yeah.

1379
00:58:01.040 --> 00:58:01.260
Yeah.

1380
00:58:01.440 --> 00:58:04.740
Oh, you guys, the chemistry between you two.

1381
00:58:05.080 --> 00:58:07.220
And it's just so like, yeah.

1382
00:58:07.660 --> 00:58:08.500
Oh my gosh.

1383
00:58:08.880 --> 00:58:10.760
You're just rooting for Don and Tim.

1384
00:58:10.980 --> 00:58:12.340
You're just rooting for them.

1385
00:58:12.720 --> 00:58:14.020
Oh, it was a really.

1386
